Package: gg2illustrate
Title: Prepare ggplot2 Figures for Illustration Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("xpf10", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "79731536+xpf10@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Provides a compact ggplot2 theme, point-based line and text size
    helpers, plain-text mathematical labels, and Cairo PDF export at journal
    figure dimensions. These tools reduce manual adjustment when figures are
    opened in vector graphics editors.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
BugReports: https://github.com/xpf10/gg2illustrate/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), grDevices, grid
Suggests: svglite (>= 2.0.0), xml2, systemfonts, ggpubr (>= 0.6.3), ggrepel
